# Class Notes

## Power BI Masterclass — Batch 01

This section contains selected learning materials and class notes from the Power BI Masterclass — Batch 01 conducted by Infinity Code Nexus.

The available notes represent selected sessions and learning topics covered during the program.

> Note: This folder contains selected class materials and is not intended to represent the complete set of session notes.

---

## Available Learning Materials

The notes may include topics related to:

- Power BI Fundamentals
- Data Import
- Data Transformation
- Power Query
- Data Cleaning
- Data Modeling
- DAX
- Data Visualization
- Dashboard Development
- Practical Exercises

